      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest refactoring for clarity. Maybe something like:\n\n    private int getPermissionBlockedState(int uid, int reasons) {\n        if (!mDeps.isAtLeastV()) return reasons;\n\n\t\tfinal boolean hasInternetPermission \u003d hasInternetPermission(uid);\n\t\tif (mDeps.isChangeEnabled(NETWORK_BLOCKED_WITHOUT_INTERNET_PERMISSION, uid)) {\n\t\t    reasons \u003d hasInternetPermission\n\t\t            ? reasons \u0026 ~BLOCKED_REASON_NO_INTERNET_PERMISSION\n\t\t            : reasons | BLOCKED_REASON_NO_INTERNET_PERMISSION;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t    reasons \u003d hasInternetPermission ? reasons : BLOCKED_REASON_NONE;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\treturn reasons;\n    }\n\n    private int getBlockedState(int uid, int firewallReasons, boolean metered, boolean vpnBlocked) {\n        reasons \u003d getPermissionBlockedState(uid, reasons);\n        if (!metered) reasons \u0026\u003d ~BLOCKED_METERED_REASON_MASK;\n        return vpnBlocked\n                ? reasons | BLOCKED_REASON_LOCKDOWN_VPN\n                : reasons \u0026 ~BLOCKED_REASON_LOCKDOWN_VPN;\n    }",
